title: Route1MoveInStart
tags: cutscene
---
// The entry node of box R1MoveIn. Starts in black (Route1ViewingEnd). He is back on the
// landing with his one box at the bottom of the stairs; she has his keys.
<<enter_box R1MoveIn>>
<<place Player PlayerArrive>>
<<face Player right>>
<<card "Saturday. Moving day.">>
<<fade_in>>
<<note r1_move "Moving day. Get the keys from Samantha, 3A.">>
You: Moving day. She has my keys.
===
title: Route1MoveInKeys
tags: cutscene
---
// Started by knocking on 3A on moving day (door_3a.yarn).
<<walk Player PlayerTo3A>>
<<face Player right>>
<<open_door Door3A>>
<<show Samantha>>
<<walk Samantha SamanthaOut>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
{$samantha_name}: Ten o'clock exactly.
{$samantha_name}: Last time you were six minutes early. I was starting to think you'd changed your mind.
You: I got the flat. Why would I change my mind?
{$samantha_name}: People do. Usually right after they read the contract.
{$samantha_name}: Two keys. The street door and 3B.
{$samantha_name}: Hold out your hand.
// PLACEHOLDER: replaces the keys menu.
{$samantha_name}: Palm up. Good.
// PLACEHOLDER lines: the spare.
You: There's a second key on your ring. It looks like mine.
{$samantha_name}: The spare. I keep it.
You: Is that a rule?
{$samantha_name}: It's a fact. Rules come later.
<<done R1MoveIn spare>>
{$samantha_name}: You do what you're told. That's going to make this very easy.
{$samantha_name}: One more thing. A housewarming present.
{$samantha_name}: Socks. A matching pair, for once. I couldn't stop thinking about the last ones.
<<set $item_blush_socks to true>>
<<done R1MoveIn socks>>
<<done R1MoveIn ask>>
You: They're... pink.
{$samantha_name}: They're blush. And they were on sale in your size. Roughly.
{$samantha_name}: Your box is still at the bottom of the stairs. I'm not carrying it.
// She goes back through her own door.
<<walk Samantha SamanthaHome>>
<<hide Samantha>>
<<close_door Door3A>>
<<done R1MoveIn keys>>
<<note r1_move "Carry the box up from the bottom of the stairs.">>
===
title: Route1MoveInBox
tags: cutscene
---
// Started from the stairs on moving day (stairs_landing.yarn): he carries his box up and
// into 3B. Then she knocks on his door.
<<fade_out>>
<<place Player PlayerInto3B>>
<<face Player down>>
<<fade_in>>
<<done R1MoveIn carry>>
<<wait 1>>
// Behind his door.
{$samantha_name}: It's me. Open up.
You: One second.
<<note r1_move "Answer the door. Find a place for the socks.">>
===
title: Route1MoveInRules
tags: cutscene
---
// Started by answering the door on moving day (door_3b_inside.yarn).
<<place Samantha SamanthaWait>>
<<show Samantha>>
<<open_door Door3B>>
<<walk Player PlayerOutOf3B>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
{$samantha_name}: You answered. Good.
{$samantha_name}: Since we're neighbours now. Three rules.
{$samantha_name}: Shoes off inside. Yours too, not just mine.
<<done R1MoveIn shoes>>
{$samantha_name}: Music off by eleven. The walls are thin.
{$samantha_name}: And if I knock, you answer.
<<done R1MoveIn answer>>
// PLACEHOLDER: replaces the rules menu.
You: I just did.
{$samantha_name}: You did. Keep it up.
{$samantha_name}: I'll let you settle in.
{$samantha_name}: The bakery opens at six. Bring me a croissant tomorrow. Call it rent.
// She goes back through her own door.
<<walk Samantha SamanthaHome>>
<<hide Samantha>>
<<close_door Door3A>>
// He goes back into his flat and the door shuts behind him.
<<walk Player PlayerInto3B>>
<<face Player down>>
<<close_door Door3B>>
<<wait 1>>
{$samantha_name}: Shoes!
You: ...They're off.
<<done R1MoveIn rules>>
<<if is_done("R1MoveIn", "stow")>>
    <<note r1_move "Unpacked. Bed.">>
<<else>>
    <<note r1_move "Find a place for the socks.">>
<<endif>>
===
